{"id": "17066", "title": "男妓回忆录", "author": "红袖添香", "category": "都市言情", "count": 116, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/17/17066.htm", "intro": "司马拉拉的老公，找了一些人，扬言要把我干掉的。我相信他的话，有钱人杀一个人，等如是杀一条狗，我不想自己死得如此贱，所以我得离开。司马拉拉的老公在北京是珠宝商，很名望的。他说要干掉我，不是吓唬我的。因为他的女人，司马拉拉跟我在一起一年半了。我们苟且在一起的行踪被他发现了，他还带着一伙兄弟站在三里屯游泳馆的更衣室，看着我跟他老婆把爱给做了。", "base": "files/article/html/17/17066", "chapters": [{"title": "正文一", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "7167372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "7167374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "7167377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "7167381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "7167385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "7167388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "7167391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "7167396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "7167399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "7167402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "7167405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "7167408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "7167411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "7167413.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "7167417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "7167420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "7167423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "7167424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "7167425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "7167426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "7167428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "7167431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "7167433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "7167435.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十五章", "file": "7167436.html", "avail